<div class="row mb-5 align-items-center g-4">
    <div class="col-lg-7">
        <p class="section-kicker">Core Financial Management</p>
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-3">Complete General Ledger & Multi-Currency Engine</h2>
        <p>
            The general ledger forms the foundation of the accounting system, recording every financial
            transaction with the integrity required for audit scrutiny. Multi-currency support is built
            into the system architecture — exchange rate tables update automatically, and the system
            computes exchange gains and losses in real time across USD, ZiG, and any additional currencies.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-0">
            Period-end controls ensure data integrity throughout the closing process. IFRS-aligned reporting
            templates generate financial statements directly from live transactional data, providing both
            operational clarity and compliance accuracy for ZIMRA and external auditors.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-5">
        <div class="vitrum-container module-feature-img border-0">
            <img src="~/images/vitrum/glass-dollar-symbol.webp" alt="Financial documents and accounting records" class="vitrum-img" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
