        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-3">ZIMRA-Ready VAT & Statutory Compliance</h2>
        <p>
            Tax management capabilities ensure that VAT obligations are tracked accurately throughout
            the transaction lifecycle. The system distinguishes between standard-rated, zero-rated,
            and exempt transactions, maintaining the audit trail required for ZIMRA review.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-0">
            Return preparation is streamlined through automated aggregation of input and output tax
            transactions. Financial statements generate directly from the general ledger in IFRS-aligned
            formats, while audit file exports facilitate external review and reduce the cost of annual
            audit processes.
        </p>
